  tenNhiemVu: "Th\u1EA3o Ph\u1EA1t S\u01A1n Kh\u1EA5u"
  loiThoaiNhanQuest: "T\xEAn Th\u1EE7 L\u0129nh S\u01A1n T\u1EB7c \xE1p gi\u1EA3i
    ma kh\xED \u0111\xE3 bi\u1EBFn Doanh Tr\u1EA1i th\xE0nh m\u1ED9t hang \u1ED5
    t\u1ED9i \xE1c, x\xFAi gi\u1EE5c b\u1ECDn tay ch\xE2n t\xE0n s\xE1t d\xE2n l\xE0nh.
    Mu\u1ED1n mang l\u1EA1i b\xECnh y\xEAn v\u0129nh vi\u1EC5n cho Thanh Tr\xFAc
    L\xE2m, ch\u1EC9 c\xF3 c\xE1ch x\xF4ng v\xE0o \u0111\u1EA1i b\u1EA3n doanh ti\xEAu
    di\u1EC7t t\xEAn Tr\u1EA1i Ch\u1EE7 n\xE0y!"
  loiThoaiDangLam: "Th\u1EE7 L\u0129nh S\u01A1n T\u1EB7c s\u1EDF h\u1EEFu v\xF5 ngh\u1EC7
    cao c\u01B0\u1EDDng l\u1EA1i c\xF3 ma kh\xED h\u1ED9 th\xE2n. \u0110\u1EA1i hi\u1EC7p
    h\xE3y t\u1EADp trung to\xE0n b\u1ED9 s\u1EE9c m\u1EA1nh \u0111\u1EC3 ti\xEAu
    di\u1EC7t h\u1EAFn!"
  loiThoaiHoanThanh: "Th\u1EE7 l\u0129nh g\u1EE5c \u0111\u1ED5, Doanh Tr\u1EA1i S\u01A1n
    T\u1EB7c ch\xEDnh th\u1EE9c tan r\xE3! Ng\xE0i ch\xEDnh l\xE0 \u0111\u1EA1i c\u1EE9u
    tinh c\u1EE7a to\xE0n b\u1ED9 b\xE1 t\xE1nh v\xF9ng Thanh Tr\xFAc L\xE2m!"
